a) Do not exceed the maximum tensile load — On runs from 40 m to 100 m, use proper lubricants and make sure they are compatible with the cable jacket. On runs over 100 m, use proper lubricants and pull from the middle out to both ends. If possible, use an automated puller with tension control or at least a breakaway-pulling eye;
