It may take one of the following forms:
a) Skeletal frames — Precast concrete components can be used to create skeletal frames, with columns and beams connected with precast framed connections;
b) Load bearing walls — Precast concrete wall panels can be used as load-bearing walls, supporting the weight of the floors and roof;
